# Tags (§3.7, §5.8) attach to the following Screen:, Element: or When:.
# A test's tags are the union of its screen's, element's and block's tags.
@smoke @regression
@owner:team-profile
Screen: User Details

  @critical
  # Comments and blank lines may separate tags from their header.

  Element: User Information
    Show: Username

    @slow
    When: Viewing another user's profile
    Hide: Full name

  @wip @日本語タグ
  Element: Edit Action
    Show: Edit button
